      <h1 class="jr-h1">Marine vs Bovine Collagen: Which Should You Take?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">
        Two collagen supplements can sit on the same shelf at the same price and behave quite
        differently once you swallow them. The marine vs bovine collagen decision comes down to
        four things: which collagen types you get, how small the peptides are, whether the source
        fits what you are willing to eat, and what you are really paying per gram.
      </p>

